@startuml
title UniReserve - Reservation State Machine
skinparam shadowing false
state "Pending Approval" as PENDING_APPROVAL
state "Confirmed" as CONFIRMED
state "Rejected" as REJECTED
state "Cancelled" as CANCELLED
[*] --> PENDING_APPROVAL : request restricted resource\n[valid interval and no conflict]
[*] --> CONFIRMED : request normal resource\n[valid interval; no confirmed conflict]
PENDING_APPROVAL --> CONFIRMED : admin approves\n[enabled; availability rechecked atomically]
PENDING_APPROVAL --> REJECTED : admin rejects
PENDING_APPROVAL --> CANCELLED : owner cancels [before start]
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : owner cancels [before start]
REJECTED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
note right of PENDING_APPROVAL
  Non-capacity-blocking.
  Multiple pending requests can overlap.
end note
note right of CONFIRMED
  Blocks overlapping confirmations,
  even if an earlier availability check said free.
end note
@enduml